@startuml
title test-support コンポーネント図
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #9E9E9E
skinparam ArrowColor #455A64
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #455A64

component "AnyListConverter" as L1
component "Any2dListConverter" as L2
component "CsvTokenParser" as Parser
component "JUnit Jupiter Params" as JUnit
component "app Unit Tests" as AppTests
component "common Unit Tests" as CommonTests

JUnit --> L1
JUnit --> L2
L1 --> Parser
L2 --> Parser
AppTests --> L1
AppTests --> L2
CommonTests --> L1
CommonTests --> L2

note bottom
test-supportはsettings.gradle.ktsの
独立projectではなく、Gradle sourceSetで共有される。
end note

@enduml
